    {
      "request": "Iron and other loot floating out of reach; animate XP/gold/materials",
      "result": "Non-quest pickups settle using gravity and a terrain probe; nearby accessible items magnetize to a live player. Six painted 4-frame cycles, low-amplitude bob and capped collection fly-in. Claims remain immediate, unique and guarded against dead players/blocked paths.",
