        "LivingSpriteAtlas.gd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "request": "Natural walls, ground fill, doors and slopes",
      "result": "Continues existing terrain envelope/portal context repair. Adds 30 shallow walkable rubble contours with measured source silhouettes (9 variants traversed both directions), 180 lower-earth joins, no slope added to boss arenas, moving bridges or narrow jump ledges.",
