      "files": [
        "ForegroundGrowth.gd",
        "WorldForegroundDressing.gd",
        "WorldAmbience.gd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "request": "Unfinished primitive scenery, unsupported props, meaningful map details",
      "result": "248 late-pass scenery replacements, 117 bark root ribbons, 45 textured water surfaces; explicit owner/name rules preserve controllers and collision. Includes tanks, boats, bell frames, instruments, urns, kilns, counters, ferns, ruin towers and 27 Outskirts backdrop buildings.",
